wip/py-av: Import py-av-19.0.2

PyAV: Pythonic Cython bindings for the FFmpeg libraries (containers,
streams, codecs, frames, filters, NumPy conversion).  Built against
multimedia/ffmpeg8: PyAV 19 uses FFmpeg 8 API (AV_FRAME_DATA_EXIF, ...)
and does not build with FFmpeg 7.  Needed by ManimGL's VideoMobject
(wip/py-manimgl).
